                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a05a4d97-5156-3849-8f69-44450d25d4b1",
                                        "entry_id": "71280111-e85b-3987-9cd6-2175181ddacf",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The number 110, 11 × 10."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "informal"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f7c1fe87-0534-4705-adfe-19ad769285a9",
                                                "sense_id": "a05a4d97-5156-3849-8f69-44450d25d4b1",
                                                "text": "Compounds with other numerals: eleventy-one (111), eleventy-six (116), eleventy first (one-hundred and eleventh), etc."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bc9f281e-97c3-4e68-8e68-dcd8fdaee88c",
                                                "sense_id": "a05a4d97-5156-3849-8f69-44450d25d4b1",
                                                "text": "[Bilbo] announced that he would shortly be celebrating his eleventy-first birthday\n[…]\n“Today is my one hundred and eleventh birthday: I am eleventy-one today!”"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cdd437fc-0a33-4eeb-9555-cf5a33b7413e",
                                                "sense_id": "a05a4d97-5156-3849-8f69-44450d25d4b1",
                                                "text": "without having to go back through the thousand and eleventy-three days to alter the plan"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8fee3d9d-1586-43e8-9fe0-fa8091d714b8",
                                                "sense_id": "a05a4d97-5156-3849-8f69-44450d25d4b1",
                                                "text": "Eight-Oh-Two-Dot-Eleventy Something [= 802.11a, 802.11b, etc.]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1673cf93-7497-3b6c-9646-4d0741349abc",
                                        "entry_id": "71280111-e85b-3987-9cd6-2175181ddacf",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An indefinite large number."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "colloquial"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f27e75c9-4eab-4c56-b338-5f759d60b472",
                                                "sense_id": "1673cf93-7497-3b6c-9646-4d0741349abc",
                                                "text": "No grown-up people, no babies, no girls. It was a world of boys, eleventy and a hundred strong."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5e0b9286-5d73-42af-97a0-e2795424a76c",
                                                "sense_id": "1673cf93-7497-3b6c-9646-4d0741349abc",
                                                "text": "People used to think that the first eleventy letters of the DNA message would comprise Gene 1."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "497b2513-944f-46b9-82f2-a18829c3cf96",
                                                "sense_id": "1673cf93-7497-3b6c-9646-4d0741349abc",
                                                "text": "According to a study by me, this generates a multibillion facepalm for the UK economy, making everyone who considers it at least eleventy hundred pounds unhappier."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "953994f5-122d-45ec-9d33-3e332c302065",
                        "source_entry_id": "2d10d5ad-de0d-3e02-916a-55cb5a89bcd4",
                        "target_lang_word": "umpteen",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "umpteen",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0e33f26c-ace4-305c-8180-879a29708f25",
                                        "entry_id": "0b3af68d-70b6-30d0-b663-79fa9e0172e9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Relatively large but unspecified in number."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "informal"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "079d2ac7-f1e4-4f27-81bd-f698f413e875",
                                                "sense_id": "0e33f26c-ace4-305c-8180-879a29708f25",
                                                "text": "She's taking umpteen friends with her to the party."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "967e4e30-c2ee-4335-987a-89f54cde7cc4",
                                                "sense_id": "0e33f26c-ace4-305c-8180-879a29708f25",
                                                "text": "We still claim a population of over 300,000 based on the new city directory, and that chief of the census who threw out umpteen thousand names on us this spring can’t put his name on our slipboard any more."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8ac36da1-7772-4fd9-8c2f-62090b342883",
                                                "sense_id": "0e33f26c-ace4-305c-8180-879a29708f25",
                                                "text": "Does it continue to make sense to have umpteen definitions of the practice of law, umpteen UPL prohibitions, umpteen UPL investigation and prosecution procedures, and umpteen UPL sanctions? The current crazy quilt of regulation in this area makes it difficult for anyone to know (including lawyers) what is and is not permitted in a particular jurisdiction."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a78519e5-0700-4de8-81d5-4bb4e44e54b9",
                                                "sense_id": "0e33f26c-ace4-305c-8180-879a29708f25",
                                                "text": "He tries, \"The few, the proud, the umpteen,\" and Shane says, \"Umpteen? Pray tell me, good sir, who is this umpteen of which you speak?\" and Joseph says, \"Umpteen Dumpteen sat on a wall,\" and they both break up laughing.\n \"It's like a bunch, isn't it? 'Umpteen'?\" This from Sean Lanham, whose small round skull has inspired Coach Dale to name him Peahead."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
